        "message": "Affected versions of com.squareup.okhttp3:okhttp are vulnerable to Improper Certificate Validation. Improper hostname verification in OkHttp's OkHostnameVerifier.verifyHostName can allow an attacker to present a certificate for the wrong domain, bypassing TLS checks and causing OkHttp to accept a malicious cert for an unintended host. This can lead to remote information disclosure without any user interaction.",
